-# full pipelines (recon/probe/fuzz/scan, each spawning subfinder,
-# httpx, nuclei, ffuf, dalfox, sqlmap, arjun subprocesses) all at once.
-# Confirmed live: load average of 83 on a 4-OCPU box, one container at
